# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Às-chur sgrìobh: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), loidhne-ùr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), loidhne-ùr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), loidhne-ùr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), loidhne-ùr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), loidhne-ùr.
Às-chur sgrìobh: ([''] tccompare: ['']), loidhne-ùr.
